# THE MACHINES WILL NOT FOLLOW (docs/HUSH.md H1): hunted out on the crags, the
# player goes back into a ring and the machines stop at its edge, facing in,
# and hold there. From above: bodies stopped on a circle; over the shoulder,
# their optics on you through the stones.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/hush_hold.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
place the_crags
coast calm
near hush_ring
mark ring
walk 1,0 1.4 run
spawn runner
spawn runner
await noticed 10
at mark:ring
wait 4.0
shot 01-held-at-the-edge-from-above with mob:runner
# The slate on one of them: what a machine held at a ring reads, from a step
# nearer them (still well inside the stones, with a clear line to them).
walkto mob 0.5
hold target
await target 5
wait 0.9
shot 01b-the-read-of-one-held with mob:runner
release target
wait 0.4
# Turned to them (a touch of the keys; still well inside the stones).
walkto mob 0.15
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 0.8
shot 02-held-at-the-edge-over-the-shoulder with shoulder
# Fen, told of it (the beat landed as they stopped): her reply about the rings.
tap shoulder
wait 0.6
at cast:fen
await cast:fen 8
press use
await talking 3
tap move_down
wait 0.2
tap move_down
wait 0.3
shot 03-telling-fen with talking,cast:fen
press use
wait 0.6
shot 04-fen-on-the-rings with talking,cast:fen
